<title>GREECE: BANK/GREECE ADDS 96.8 BLN DRACHMAS IN 5-DAY REPOS.</title>
<headline>BANK/GREECE ADDS 96.8 BLN DRACHMAS IN 5-DAY REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece allocated 96.8 billion drachmas in five-day securities repurchase funds at 12.90 percent, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Bids were fully satisfied,&quot; it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
